 🔐 Phishing Detection System (Cybersecurity Project)

  Overview
This project is a beginner-level cybersecurity flowchart that explains how phishing attacks are detected, analyzed, and prevented using a structured security workflow.

It visually represents how a system identifies suspicious emails and protects users from malicious links.

 🚀 Project Flow

Email Received  
⬇️  
Suspicious Link Detection  
⬇️  
System Security Scan  
⬇️  
Risk Analysis (Safe / Unsafe)  
⬇️  
User Warning or Block Action  
⬇️  
Incident Report Generation  

 🧠 Key Concepts
- Phishing Attack Detection  
- Cybersecurity Workflow  
- Risk Analysis System  
- Threat Prevention  

